  "body": "If you're looking for a home that brings together space, comfort and effortless entertaining, this sunny family property has it all!\r\n\r\nDesigned with family living in mind, the home offers two separate living areas, providing plenty of room for everyone to spread out and relax. The seamless indoor-outdoor flow leads straight to a fantastic BBQ and entertaining area, perfect for bringing family and friends together all year round.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom enjoys its own ensuite and direct access to the outdoor entertaining area, creating a lovely private retreat. Three additional bedrooms are conveniently positioned on the same level, with a centrally located family bathroom servicing the rest of the home.\r\n\r\nThe extra-height double garage, complete with a separate laundry, offers even more flexibility. Part of the garage has been converted into an additional room, creating a fantastic teenage retreat, guest space or work-from-home option. Alternatively, it can be returned to its original garage configuration if preferred.\r\n\r\nThe second outdoor entertaining area features a beautiful pool surrounded by decking, creating the perfect spot to soak up the afternoon sun, cool off on those warm summer days or simply sit back and unwind with family and friends.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 1,116m2; section of usable land, there's plenty of room for the kids to play, along with loads of off-street parking for the boat, campervan and extra vehicles.\r\n\r\nLocation is another standout feature. The marina is just a short walk away, while the local transport ferry and bus services are conveniently close to home. Shops, cafés and restaurants are also all within easy walking distance, making everyday living and weekend enjoyment wonderfully convenient.\r\n\r\nWith sunshine, space, flexible living, fantastic entertaining areas and an enviable location, this is a home the whole family can enjoy.\r\n\r\nThere's room for everyone here - and plenty of reasons to stay!",
